{"path":"thread/mtx_init","title":"mtx_init","titleHtml":"mtx_init","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/c/thread/mtx_init","section":"thread","kind":"page","summary":"Creates a new mutex object with type. The object pointed to by mutex is set to an identifier of the newly created mutex.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/c/thread\"><code>&lt;threads.h&gt;</code></a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-c11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> mtx_init<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/c/thread\"><span class=\"kw1011\">mtx_t</span></a><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> mutex, <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> type <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c11\">(since C11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Creates a new mutex object with <code>type</code>. The object pointed to by <code>mutex</code> is set to an identifier of the newly created mutex.\n</p><p><code>type</code> must have one of the following values:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/c/thread/mtx_types\">mtx_plain</a></span> - a simple, non-recursive mutex is created.\n</li><li><span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/c/thread/mtx_types\">mtx_timed</a></span> - a non-recursive mutex, that supports timeout, is created.\n</li><li><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><a href=\"/w/c/thread/mtx_types\"><span class=\"kw1017\">mtx_plain</span></a> <span class=\"sy3\">|</span> <a href=\"/w/c/thread/mtx_types\"><span class=\"kw1018\">mtx_recursive</span></a></span></code> - a recursive mutex is created.\n</li><li><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><a href=\"/w/c/thread/mtx_types\"><span class=\"kw1019\">mtx_timed</span></a> <span class=\"sy3\">|</span> <a href=\"/w/c/thread/mtx_types\"><span class=\"kw1018\">mtx_recursive</span></a></span></code> - a recursive mutex, that supports timeout, is created.\n</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td>  mutex\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td>  pointer to the mutex to initialize\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td>  type\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td>  the type of the mutex\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/c/thread/thrd_errors\">thrd_success</a></span> if successful, <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/c/thread/thrd_errors\">thrd_error</a></span> otherwise.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"References\">References</h3>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-17\">\n<ul><li> C17 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2018): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.26.4.2 The mtx_init function (p: 277-278)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-11\">\n<ul><li> C11 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2011): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.26.4.2 The mtx_init function (p: 381)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/mutex/mutex\">C++ documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>mutex</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/timed_mutex/timed_mutex\">C++ documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>timed_mutex</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/recursive_mutex/recursive_mutex\">C++ documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>recursive_mutex</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/recursive_timed_mutex/recursive_timed_mutex\">C++ documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>recursive_timed_mutex</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"References","id":"References"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C reference"},{"path":"thread","title":"Concurrency support library"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"mtx_init","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Creates a new mutex object with type. The object pointed to by mutex is set to an identifier of the newly created mutex."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"mutex, type"},{"label":"Return value","note":"thrd_success if successful, thrd_error otherwise."},{"label":"See also"}]},"standards":["C11"],"wordCount":145,"codeBlockCount":0}
